      {
        "id": "tb-install",
        "moduleId": "instrument-agent",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "教材：安装运行、监控与评估所需的库",
        "markdown": "教材把依赖分成四组：\n\n1. `smolagents[telemetry]`：带遥测支持的智能体库本体；\n2. OpenTelemetry 组件 `opentelemetry-sdk` 与 `opentelemetry-exporter-otlp`：生成并导出追踪数据；\n3. `openinference-instrumentation-smolagents`：把 smolagents 的内部步骤接入 OpenTelemetry 的适配层；\n4. `langfuse`、`datasets`，以及用于界面演示的 `smolagents[gradio]`。\n\n```python\n%pip install 'smolagents[telemetry]'\n%pip install opentelemetry-sdk opentelemetry-exporter-otlp openinference-instrumentation-smolagents\n%pip install langfuse datasets 'smolagents[gradio]'\n```",
