        "id": "tb-dataset-run",
        "moduleId": "offline-dataset-eval",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "教材：在数据集上运行智能体并比较配置",
        "markdown": "教材先写一个包装函数：启动跨度、运行智能体、把追踪 ID 落地；再遍历数据集条目，把追踪链接到条目，并可选地写入评估分数。\n\n```python\ndef run_smolagent(question):\n    with tracer.start_as_current_span('Smolagent-Trace') as span:\n        span.set_attribute('langfuse.tag', 'dataset-run')\n        output = agent.run(question)\n        current_span = trace.get_current_span()\n        formatted_trace_id = format_trace_id(current_span.get_span_context().trace_id)\n        langfuse_trace = langfuse.trace(id=formatted_trace_id, input=question, output=output)\n    return langfuse_trace, output\n\nfor item in dataset.items:\n    langfuse_trace, output = run_smolagent(item.input['text'])\n    item.link(langfuse_trace, run_name='smolagent-notebook-run-01', run_metadata={'model': model.model_id})\n\nlangfuse.flush()\n```\n\n之后换不同配置重复同一过程——模型、工具、系统提示——就能在可观测性工具中并排比较多次运行。结束前调用 `flush()`，确保遥测数据全部发出。",
